WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:06.090 align:start position:0%
 
Peggy's 16  Italy World War two this proud nation  has suffered under years of fascistic  and growing influence from Nazi Germany  the Allied victory in North Africa has  stretched the axis held on the  Mediterranean to breaking point the time  to strike is now but the Allies need  more than a plan they need a specialist  an elite marksman who can sow chaos in  enemy ranks and hunt down the Nazi  weapon system that threatens not only  the invasion of Italy but victory in  Europe welcome to the most advanced  sniping game ever built a tactical  third-person shooter delivering emergent  free-flowing combat and genre Louisville  welcome to Sniper Elite 4 central to  Sniper Elite 4 is an expansive campaign  for one to two players across the  largest most diverse environments ever  seen in a world war 2 game from sleepy  fishing villages to mountainous valleys  ancient forests and more still untouched  by the bloody conflict that has ravaged  most of Europe each huge campaign level  is many times bigger than any previous  Sniper Elite game offering hours of pure  tactical combat gameplay freedom and  epic long shots traverse these vast  environments to find your ideal sniper  nest how to maneuver your enemies or  hunt them up close explore every inch  for hidden regions collectibles and  optional side missions that can be  completed in any order  deploy deep behind enemy lines you must  learn to observe the enemy and adapt to  the flow of battle with a combination of  your binoculars and Intel from Italian  resistance you can identify priority  targets track enemy movements plan  explosive ambushes and pick out more  creative opportunities use your athletic  prowess to scale vertical terrain with  ease get the drop on enemies for a range  of silent takedowns with any position or  find your own cyber nests to pick apart  the enemy at range offering a deep and  rewarding sniping simulation players can  deliver pinpoint assassinations from  extreme distance adapting to wind and  gravity and adjusting for range with  scope 0e for long shots over hundreds of  metres and when the hornet's nest has  been stirred cover your tracks with a  nasty surprise  keeping your enemy guessing is the key  to victory  silenced pistols can be combined with  distractions to torment enemy formations  luring them into traps and isolating  priority targets when engaging the enemy  at range  you can now load silent subsonic ammo  into your rifles delivering a much  quieter shot that's less likely to alert  nearby enemy forces  even without suppressed firearms expert  sharpshooters can mask their rifle fire  by timing shots with artillery and other  sounds of the battlefield  and make no mistake  sniper you'll want to tip the odds in  your favour with hundreds of fascist  troops armored vehicles and tanks in any  one environment every encounter will  provide a stern test special attention  must be paid to elite enemy units such  as the heavily armed Jaeger troops or  radio operators who can call in waves of  new enemy reinforcements to turn the  tide against you but the enemy's  strength can also be its weakness  assassinate an officer and you can  search his body for a logbook that  reveals the location of all his troops  and while the enemy spotters can use  their flare guns to call an artillery  strike on your positions that same  weapon can be used to rain down death on  Nazi defensive position  you might always be outnumbered but  you'll never be outgunned with weapons  and items to choose from including  iconic World War two rifles submachine  gun shot guns and explosives and heavy  weapons with decimating fearful patrols  agents can adapt their loadouts  for any mission players can also upgrade  their weapons core attributes from scope  magnification to stability recoil muzzle  velocity and more and no more crucial is  your arsenal than in Sniper Elite Force  wealth of online co-op and multiplayer  modes set across six beautiful  custom-designed Maps the dedicated co-op  loads for up to four players your team  play will be tested as a sniper and  spotter all pitted against ever  escalating enemy forces in a battle for  survival for competitive sharpshooters  seven adversarial modes bring sniper  elites trademark mechanics to the fall  ratcheting up the tension in a battle of  timing position and skill across  challenging terrain filled with hidden  sniping nests and deadly kill zone  it's time to deploy a sniper it's time  to liberate Italy and set the wheels in  motion for victory in Europe because one  bullet can change history  [Music]

